I made eye contact with the baby.

1013
00:43:55.534 --> 00:43:56.767
I can see the baby's eyes now

1014
00:43:56.834 --> 00:43:57.735
(tree) Yes?

1015
00:44:02.062 --> 00:44:04.600
(Lee Young) The baby must come down face down.
It's much easier

1016
00:44:04.667 --> 00:44:06.450
It's hard to come down while looking at the sky.

1017
00:44:06.517 --> 00:44:07.600
[Sobbing]

1018
00:44:08.928 --> 00:44:11.182
Ah, then what should I do?

1019
00:44:11.901 --> 00:44:12.850
(Lee Young) That’s...

1020
00:44:13.951 --> 00:44:15.319
much more than now

1021
00:44:15.386 --> 00:44:16.400
You have to push harder.

1022
00:44:16.467 --> 00:44:17.955
[Lee Young’s hands clapping]
Let's try it

1023
00:44:18.022 --> 00:44:19.133
Now, harder

1024
00:44:19.200 --> 00:44:20.491
again

1025
00:44:20.558 --> 00:44:22.863
One, two, three, take a breath!

1026
00:44:22.930 --> 00:44:24.534
[Scream of the tree]

1027
00:44:24.601 --> 00:44:26.933
(Lee Young) Power!
[Sound of trees strengthening]

1028
00:44:27.000 --> 00:44:30.034
Harder, more, more, longer, more!

1029
00:44:30.671 --> 00:44:32.270
[cell phone ringing sound]

1030
00:44:34.338 --> 00:44:35.339
(Dong-eun) Wait a minute

1031
00:44:38.376 --> 00:44:39.567
yes, teacher

1032
00:44:39.634 --> 00:44:41.345
(Japanese) Teacher, this is the patient Yong Jin-sook.

1033
00:44:41.846 --> 00:44:43.848
Did you check the chest x-ray?

1034
00:44:43.915 --> 00:44:44.816
(Dong-eun) Ah

1035
00:44:45.650 --> 00:44:48.088
I requested it earlier, but

1036
00:44:48.155 --> 00:44:50.187
Confirmation not yet

1037
00:44:50.254 --> 00:44:51.589
Oh, sorry.

1038
00:44:52.125 --> 00:44:54.500
(Jaeil) So what are the results of OTPT follow-up?

1039
00:44:54.567 --> 00:44:56.730
(Dong-eun) Uh... just a moment

1040
00:44:56.797 --> 00:44:58.129
Let me check it out

1041
00:45:06.373 --> 00:45:07.529
Ah...

1042
00:45:07.596 --> 00:45:11.878
I don’t think it was floating when I saw it earlier.

1043
00:45:11.945 --> 00:45:12.933
(Jay) Ah...

1044
00:45:13.000 --> 00:45:14.128
So what about hemoglobin?

1045
00:45:14.195 --> 00:45:17.348
Well, I'm good at that too...

1046
00:45:18.185 --> 00:45:19.239
(Jay) Ah...

1047
00:45:20.339 --> 00:45:21.986
I'll go to the ward later and look for it.

1048
00:45:22.628 --> 00:45:23.861
It's okay

1049
00:45:23.928 --> 00:45:25.223
(Dong-eun) Thank you, teacher

1050
00:45:26.529 --> 00:45:27.625
sorry

1051
00:45:28.795 --> 00:45:29.694
[Call end sound]

1052
00:45:30.661 --> 00:45:31.795
(Intern) Shouldn’t I go?

1053
00:45:31.862 --> 00:45:33.066
(Dong-eun) Umm

1054
00:45:33.133 --> 00:45:34.031
It's okay

1055
00:45:35.462 --> 00:45:37.068
(Intern) I said I didn’t know everything, but you didn’t get scolded?

1056
00:45:39.221 --> 00:45:43.140
Yes, the teacher is a first year major and he is very nice.

1057
00:45:43.207 --> 00:45:45.576
I don't get angry or annoyed

1058
00:45:45.643 --> 00:45:47.011
I don't even scold you

1059
00:45:47.078 --> 00:45:48.228
(Intern) Wow...

1060
00:45:48.295 --> 00:45:49.714
Namdong is a mess

1061
00:45:50.675 --> 00:45:51.749
Should I go to the gynecologist?

1062
00:45:51.816 --> 00:45:53.120
[Dong-eun’s light smile]

1063
00:45:53.187 --> 00:45:54.485
If I don't work

1064
00:45:54.552 --> 00:45:55.722
I do all that too

1065
00:45:55.789 --> 00:45:57.188
Cover up any mistakes

1066
00:45:57.829 --> 00:45:59.590
Please listen to all my requests

1067
00:45:59.657 --> 00:46:01.993
Write, what should I say?

1068
00:46:03.096 --> 00:46:04.463
The easy type?

1069
00:46:05.029 --> 00:46:06.197
IC

1070
00:46:07.431 --> 00:46:09.038
(Dong-eun) If you roughly crush it,

1071
00:46:09.105 --> 00:46:10.700
He took care of everything himself.

1072
00:46:10.767 --> 00:46:12.703
[Sound of putting down chopsticks]
[Sound of chair being pulled]

1073
00:46:17.596 --> 00:46:18.910
Your name is Nam Dong-eun?

1074
00:46:22.583 --> 00:46:23.667
Enjoy your meal

1075
00:46:27.934 --> 00:46:29.720
[Calm music]
[Sound of chair being pulled]

1076
00:46:31.534 --> 00:46:32.637
[Sound of chair being put in]

1077
00:46:44.171 --> 00:46:46.204
[Keyboard operation sound]

1078
00:46:55.382 --> 00:46:56.650
Teacher Nam Dong-eun

1079
00:46:56.717 --> 00:46:58.649
- (Japan) Baek Geum-young, patient ABGA
- (Dong-eun) Ah!

1080
00:46:59.216 --> 00:47:00.995
I was going to go and do it now, really.

1081
00:47:01.062 --> 00:47:02.119
(Jae-Jae) I did it

1082
00:47:02.823 --> 00:47:04.183
You looked busy earlier.

1083
00:47:04.925 --> 00:47:05.886
(Dong-eun) Ah...
[Keyboard operation sound]

1084
00:47:08.128 --> 00:47:09.260
thank you

1085
00:47:14.501 --> 00:47:15.538
and

1086
00:47:17.995 --> 00:47:19.136
sorry

1087
00:47:22.728 --> 00:47:23.674
Done

1088
00:47:24.411 --> 00:47:27.214
ABGA is the most difficult when you are an intern.

1089
00:47:28.415 --> 00:47:30.100
When a patient is in pain, their hands also tremble.

1090
00:47:30.573 --> 00:47:33.734
Oh, that's not it...

1091
00:47:33.801 --> 00:47:35.434
(Residence in Japan) Around October of the first year

1092
00:47:35.501 --> 00:47:36.754
You're throwing needles, right?

1093
00:47:37.324 --> 00:47:39.790
Then it sticks on your wrist.

1094
00:47:40.424 --> 00:47:42.062
Ah, teacher

1095
00:47:42.129 --> 00:47:43.300
Just kidding

1096
00:47:43.367 --> 00:47:44.629
[Jaeil’s light smile]

1097
00:47:45.629 --> 00:47:48.001
Uh, I'm off work now.

1098
00:47:48.068 --> 00:47:49.133
I have nothing to do anymore

1099
00:47:50.904 --> 00:47:51.969
[Dong-eun’s sigh]

1100
00:47:54.928 --> 00:47:56.207
Because it's okay

1101
00:47:57.601 --> 00:47:58.509
Let's go and see

1102
00:48:01.761 --> 00:48:02.747
[Dong-eun’s sigh]

1103
00:48:03.517 --> 00:48:04.436
yes

1104
00:48:11.358 --> 00:48:12.623
(Dong-eun) I’ll go.

1105
00:48:20.295 --> 00:48:21.265
sorry

1106
00:48:23.229 --> 00:48:24.268
See you tomorrow

1107
00:48:31.411 --> 00:48:32.677
[deep sigh]

1108
00:48:33.496 --> 00:48:34.529
Eom Jae-il

1109
00:48:34.596 --> 00:48:36.147
Blood test results of patient Su-mi Yoon...

1110
00:48:41.255 --> 00:48:42.279
Teacher...

1111
00:48:44.231 --> 00:48:46.460
[Jaeil’s trembling breathing]

1112
00:48:46.527 --> 00:48:47.993
[Calm music]
[sigh]

1113
00:48:50.130 --> 00:48:51.996
[Jaeil’s deep sigh]

1114
00:48:57.734 --> 00:48:59.003
[Jaeil exhales]

1115
00:49:00.274 --> 00:49:02.043
Why do you come here if you don't even smoke?

1116
00:49:03.644 --> 00:49:06.177
(Jae-il) If you smoke when you’re feeling stuffy,
They say they feel refreshed.

1117
00:49:07.881 --> 00:49:09.132
I'm trying to get in the mood

1118
00:49:10.133 --> 00:49:11.315
[Jaeil takes a breath]

1119
00:49:11.868 --> 00:49:13.117
[Jaeil exhales]

1120
00:49:14.021 --> 00:49:15.178
(Dowon) What should I do?

1121
00:49:15.887 --> 00:49:16.656
uh?

1122
00:49:16.723 --> 00:49:19.556
Should I go and punish this bastard?

1123
00:49:19.623 --> 00:49:21.659
Or come right away
Are you telling me to kneel down and apologize?

1124
00:49:23.362 --> 00:49:24.562
You said you wouldn't do it

1125
00:49:28.936 --> 00:49:29.908
(Dowon) No...

1126
00:49:31.168 --> 00:49:33.537
I have something to do
I do that because I don’t think so.

1127
00:49:36.610 --> 00:49:37.556
yes

1128
00:49:39.179 --> 00:49:40.277
I have to solve it

1129
00:49:40.862 --> 00:49:41.946
[sigh]

1130
00:49:44.095 --> 00:49:45.015
Eom Jae-il

1131
00:49:46.617 --> 00:49:48.819
Getting angry and scolding
That's not easy

1132
00:49:49.429 --> 00:49:51.767
(Dowon) Even people who scold me
It's uncomfortable and noticeable

1133
00:49:51.834 --> 00:49:53.557
I'm worried, but

1134
00:49:54.191 --> 00:49:55.594
I still have to do it though
I don't do that for nothing.

1135
00:49:55.661 --> 00:49:57.461
If you do something wrong, it's natural to get scolded.

1136
00:49:58.229 --> 00:50:00.367
And for an intern, rather than a good person

1137
00:50:00.434 --> 00:50:02.269
Even if I scold you
teach me what's wrong

1138
00:50:02.336 --> 00:50:03.801
We need more people like that

1139
00:50:05.628 --> 00:50:06.637
Didn’t you say that?

1140
00:50:07.728 --> 00:50:09.467
(Jae-il) Than when I got scolded so much

1141
00:50:09.534 --> 00:50:12.446
It's okay, just do better next time

1142
00:50:12.513 --> 00:50:14.867
It's not your fault
They tell us it's our fault

1143
00:50:14.934 --> 00:50:17.047
I just wanted to do better, right?

1144
00:50:17.114 --> 00:50:18.921
I don't want to make a mistake again

1145
00:50:18.988 --> 00:50:19.850
Who said that?

1146
00:50:19.917 --> 00:50:20.885
This is teacher Eunmi.

1147
00:50:22.456 --> 00:50:23.721
Hey, that's...

1148
00:50:26.189 --> 00:50:28.434
(Dowon) That’s because you’re nice.

1149
00:50:28.501 --> 00:50:29.534
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1150
00:50:29.601 --> 00:50:30.730
Because you are nice

1151
00:50:30.797 --> 00:50:33.597
Eunmi’s good intentions
Because I’m the kind of person who accepts you with gratitude.

1152
00:50:33.664 --> 00:50:34.966
So that's how it works

1153
00:50:35.033 --> 00:50:36.800
Hey, oh my god, huh?

1154
00:50:36.867 --> 00:50:38.367
No, there aren't many people like that in this hospital.

1155
00:50:38.434 --> 00:50:40.444
Usually, they take advantage of it and make light of it.

1156
00:50:41.972 --> 00:50:43.801
How comfortable and good it is to live badly

1157
00:50:43.868 --> 00:50:45.943
Who lives like you do?
Like a fool?

1158
00:50:47.100 --> 00:50:48.012
Then

1159
00:50:48.715 --> 00:50:49.716
What should I do now?

1160
00:50:52.419 --> 00:50:54.408
But I can't tell you to live a bad life.

1161
00:50:56.562 --> 00:50:57.922
Ugh, I don't know either.

1162
00:51:01.128 --> 00:51:03.964
If you do something wrong, scold me, and if you do something right, praise me.
Let's start with that

1163
00:51:04.031 --> 00:51:06.931
(Dowon) And then
When you get angry, when you comfort me

1164
00:51:07.932 --> 00:51:10.367
The criteria for judging that?
Wouldn’t something like that happen?

1165
00:51:11.805 --> 00:51:12.713
(Japan) Yes

1166
00:51:13.671 --> 00:51:15.205
(Dowon) Even if you just make that clear

1167
00:51:15.272 --> 00:51:16.841
Juniors usually like it.

1168
00:51:18.145 --> 00:51:19.059
yes

1169
00:51:21.982 --> 00:51:22.967
But teacher

1170
00:51:24.982 --> 00:51:26.550
Did I mention I love you?

1171
00:51:27.321 --> 00:51:28.385
And that too much?

1172
00:51:30.190 --> 00:51:31.183
Going

1173
00:51:36.230 --> 00:51:37.228
(Jae-il) Let’s go together

1174
00:51:40.968 --> 00:51:42.395
[Call connection tone]
(Minjoo) Mother, you need to breathe.

1175
00:51:42.462 --> 00:51:43.737
Give the baby oxygen

1176
00:51:43.804 --> 00:51:46.803
[The tree's labored breathing]
I'll take a deep breath and then let it out.

1177
00:51:46.870 --> 00:51:47.795
yes, good

1178
00:51:47.862 --> 00:51:50.474
[The tree’s heavy breathing]
Take a breath and boo

1179
00:51:50.541 --> 00:51:52.376
Teacher, did you receive the text?

1180
00:51:52.876 --> 00:51:54.144
VD I don’t think it will work

1181
00:51:54.211 --> 00:51:55.415
(Eunwon) Just give it 30 more minutes

1182
00:51:55.482 --> 00:51:56.450
(Lee Young) No, you can’t.

1183
00:51:56.517 --> 00:51:58.018
I really can't do it anymore

1184
00:51:58.085 --> 00:51:59.816
I told you it was OP.

1185
00:51:59.883 --> 00:52:01.451
The baby isn't coming down at all.

1186
00:52:01.518 --> 00:52:03.123
Are you sure you did it right?

1187
00:52:03.190 --> 00:52:05.158
(Lee Young) Yes, I worked really hard.

1188
00:52:05.225 --> 00:52:06.734
I'm still pushing it

1189
00:52:06.801 --> 00:52:08.962
over 2 and a half hours
There are no major changes to the station.

1190
00:52:09.029 --> 00:52:10.000
The fetus is also OP.

1191
00:52:10.067 --> 00:52:12.763
Maternity chart
I'm too tired to cooperate.

1192
00:52:12.830 --> 00:52:13.694
So?

1193
00:52:13.761 --> 00:52:15.702
The mother was in labor for two and a half hours.

1194
00:52:15.769 --> 00:52:17.070
Are you saying we should have surgery now?

1195
00:52:17.137 --> 00:52:18.869
Yes, that's what I said.

1196
00:52:19.339 --> 00:52:20.271
Shall we find out about the operating room?

1197
00:52:20.804 --> 00:52:21.872
[sigh]

1198
00:52:23.329 --> 00:52:24.478
(Lee Young) Teacher?

1199
00:52:24.545 --> 00:52:25.534
Hey

1200
00:52:25.601 --> 00:52:27.500
Are you telling me to go full section now?

1201
00:52:27.567 --> 00:52:28.912
(Eunwon) Don’t you know that’s the worst?

1202
00:52:28.979 --> 00:52:30.013
I know

1203
00:52:30.080 --> 00:52:31.828
[Interesting music]

1204
00:52:31.895 --> 00:52:33.687
I think I need surgery

1205
00:52:33.754 --> 00:52:35.388
(Eunwon) They said they would let me do a VD?

1206
00:52:35.455 --> 00:52:36.720
How many times have I told you!

1207
00:52:37.391 --> 00:52:40.490
I can't do it
I need surgery, surgery!

1208
00:52:40.557 --> 00:52:42.062
(Eunwon) Hey, are you out of your mind?

1209
00:52:42.129 --> 00:52:43.527
I'm talking informally...
[Call end sound]

1210
00:52:46.233 --> 00:52:47.397
[Scream of the tree]

1211
00:52:47.464 --> 00:52:48.933
Hold your breath a little longer
Just one more time, just one more time

1212
00:52:49.000 --> 00:52:49.933
[Sound of curtain being pulled back]

1213
00:52:50.000 --> 00:52:51.438
(Eunwon) Mother, are you okay?

1214
00:52:51.505 --> 00:52:52.774
Let me take a look

1215
00:52:53.307 --> 00:52:57.367
(tree) Teacher, it hurts so much

1216
00:52:57.434 --> 00:53:00.410
(Lee Young) I can’t cooperate with exertion.
It's almost 3 hours since I went into labor.

1217
00:53:00.477 --> 00:53:01.679
They say there is an operating room.

1218
00:53:04.151 --> 00:53:06.233
[The tree groans in pain]

1219
00:53:06.300 --> 00:53:08.752
The mother is having a hard time
Then baby

1220
00:53:08.819 --> 00:53:10.688
[The tree’s heavy breathing]
When decell gets worse

1221
00:53:12.001 --> 00:53:13.524
[Beep sound]

1222
00:53:15.896 --> 00:53:17.127
[surprised gasp]

1223
00:53:18.532 --> 00:53:19.528
Teacher Oh I-young!

1224
00:53:22.936 --> 00:53:25.202
(Eunwon) What did you do instead of taking the mother to the operating room?
[Interesting music]

1225
00:53:25.269 --> 00:53:27.704
until the baby monitor falls off
What are you waiting for?

1226
00:53:27.771 --> 00:53:29.139
Don't you have that much judgment?

1227
00:53:30.001 --> 00:53:30.841
Me from earlier!

1228
00:53:30.908 --> 00:53:32.913
What are you doing? Don't push me to the operating room

1229
00:53:32.980 --> 00:53:33.847
quickly

1230
00:53:33.914 --> 00:53:35.666
[Sound of curtain being pulled back]

1231
00:53:35.733 --> 00:53:37.615
[The tree's labored breathing]

1232
00:53:38.615 --> 00:53:39.683
[Lee Young’s dumbfounded sigh]

1233
00:53:43.821 --> 00:53:45.022
[laughter]

1234
00:53:59.640 --> 00:54:01.377
[cell phone ringing sound]

1235
00:54:04.975 --> 00:54:05.767
yes

1236
00:54:05.834 --> 00:54:08.311
(Delivery driver) Hey, I’m delivering flowers.

1237
00:54:08.378 --> 00:54:10.517
Oh, teacher, not the lobby, but the parking lot.

1238
00:54:10.584 --> 00:54:12.367
Please come to the very back of the parking lot.

1239
00:54:12.434 --> 00:54:14.985
(Delivery driver) Oh, sorry about that.

1240
00:54:15.923 --> 00:54:16.785
Yes?

1241
00:54:18.306 --> 00:54:20.049
By any chance?

1242
00:54:20.116 --> 00:54:21.667
(Delivery driver) Oh, by any chance, Gu Do-won?

1243
00:54:21.734 --> 00:54:22.726
(Dowon) Ah, yes

1244
00:54:23.293 --> 00:54:24.461
(Delivery driver) Oh, sorry.

1245
00:54:24.528 --> 00:54:27.431
I collided with a bus in front of here and

1246
00:54:29.136 --> 00:54:30.434
no

1247
00:54:30.501 --> 00:54:32.669
Are you okay?
Are you hurt anywhere else?

1248
00:54:32.736 --> 00:54:34.771
(Delivery Driver) Yeah, I’m fine.

1249
00:54:34.838 --> 00:54:36.506
This flower is like this

1250
00:54:36.573 --> 00:54:37.574
sorry

1251
00:54:38.108 --> 00:54:40.080
It's okay, you don't have to worry about it.

1252
00:54:40.147 --> 00:54:41.178
(Delivery driver) I’m sorry.

1253
00:54:42.082 --> 00:54:43.367
[cell phone ringing sound]

1254
00:54:43.434 --> 00:54:44.267
(Resident) Park Jeong-wook?

1255
00:54:44.334 --> 00:54:45.282
(Delivery driver) Yes

1256
00:54:45.786 --> 00:54:47.534
-Are you in any more pain?
- (Delivery driver) Yes, yes.

1257
00:54:47.601 --> 00:54:48.534
(Dowon) Yes, hello?

1258
00:54:48.601 --> 00:54:50.467
(Restaurant Employee) This is the restaurant
This is the moment I saw.

1259
00:54:50.534 --> 00:54:51.488
(Dowon) Ah, yes

1260
00:54:51.555 --> 00:54:53.333
(Restaurant staff) Reservation confirmation car
I called you

1261
00:54:53.400 --> 00:54:55.192
Tomorrow at 9 o'clock, you two.

1262
00:54:55.259 --> 00:54:56.827
- (Dowon) No, today.
- (Restaurant Employee) Yes?

1263
00:54:57.423 --> 00:54:58.985
You made a reservation for tomorrow?

1264
00:54:59.634 --> 00:55:01.234
I made a reservation on the 13th?

1265
00:55:01.301 --> 00:55:04.468
(Restaurant Employee) Yes, the 13th is tomorrow?
Today is the 12th

