[Microphone ringing]

1523
01:07:37.220 --> 01:07:38.225
Ah, hey!

1524
01:07:38.292 --> 01:07:40.456
This is the climax now!

1525
01:07:40.523 --> 01:07:41.928
Oh my, I'm sorry.

1526
01:07:41.995 --> 01:07:43.192
You did that on purpose, right?

1527
01:07:43.259 --> 01:07:45.228
Still, you guys came to karaoke with me.
[Remote control operation sound]

1528
01:07:45.295 --> 01:07:46.396
I have to listen to this

1529
01:07:50.234 --> 01:07:52.268
[Exciting accompaniment]

1530
01:07:57.878 --> 01:08:01.515
♪ I can’t let you go like this ♪

1531
01:08:02.082 --> 01:08:05.815
(Japan) ♪ Nothing
Because you can't separate us ♪

1532
01:08:05.882 --> 01:08:08.100
♪ Now I know I'm a bad boy ♪

1533
01:08:08.167 --> 01:08:10.066
♪ And I know you're a good girl ♪

1534
01:08:10.133 --> 01:08:11.434
♪ My eyes are blinded by love... ♪

1535
01:08:11.501 --> 01:08:13.467
[Song of Zainichi]
(Namkyung) He came here to do that.

1536
01:08:13.534 --> 01:08:14.763
(Lee Young) Oh, is that song?

1537
01:08:15.525 --> 01:08:18.461
- (Namkyung) Yes, Hi Boys.
- (Jaeil) ♪ I made you cry a lot ♪

1538
01:08:18.528 --> 01:08:19.866
♪ I can’t do it the way I want ♪

1539
01:08:19.933 --> 01:08:22.365
♪ Loving you ♪

1540
01:08:23.131 --> 01:08:25.705
♪ The two of us in our younger days ♪

1541
01:08:25.772 --> 01:08:30.139
♪ Unripe memories of my first love ♪

1542
01:08:30.711 --> 01:08:33.242
♪ This song brings us ♪

1543
01:08:33.309 --> 01:08:37.981
♪ I hope I can take it back to that time ♪

1544
01:08:38.852 --> 01:08:40.650
[Exciting accompaniment]

1545
01:08:43.156 --> 01:08:44.287
(Nanjing) Wow

1546
01:08:45.425 --> 01:08:46.723
(Lee Young) Eom Jae-il

1547
01:08:47.427 --> 01:08:48.545
(Nanjing) Daebak

1548
01:08:51.901 --> 01:08:53.146
Wow

1549
01:08:55.434 --> 01:08:56.608
(Lee Young) It’s different

1550
01:09:01.241 --> 01:09:02.672
(Namkyung) Why are you doing so well?

1551
01:09:10.684 --> 01:09:12.506
[Exciting Accompaniment - Continued]

1552
01:09:44.870 --> 01:09:46.182
[Jaeil's heavy breathing]

1553
01:09:47.395 --> 01:09:49.256
[Fanfare plays]
[Applause from Nam Kyung and Lee Young]

1554
01:09:49.323 --> 01:09:51.563
- (Namkyung) Wow!
- (Lee Young) Kim Sa-bi is awesome

1555
01:09:52.997 --> 01:09:54.624
[rough sigh]
[Namkyung and Lee Young’s laughter]

1556
01:09:56.225 --> 01:09:57.193
(Lee Young) You saved it, right?

1557
01:09:57.260 --> 01:09:59.262
[Lee Young’s laughter]

1558
01:09:59.896 --> 01:10:01.464
- (Lee Young) Oh, idol
- (Namkyung) Sabi, is this correct, huh?

1559
01:10:01.531 --> 01:10:02.798
Is this correct?

1560
01:10:02.865 --> 01:10:04.300
- (Lee Young) Oh
- (Namkyung) Kim Sa-bi

1561
01:10:04.367 --> 01:10:05.205
- (Lee Young) Oh
- (Namkyung) Kim Sa-bi

1562
01:10:05.272 --> 01:10:07.136
(Sabi) Don’t do it, don’t do it
[Nanjing’s laughter]

1563
01:10:07.674 --> 01:10:09.138
(Lee Young) Hey, I’ve liked you from the beginning.

1564
01:10:09.205 --> 01:10:10.106
(Sabi) I don’t know

1565
01:10:11.385 --> 01:10:12.279
(Namkyung) Hey, Sabi.

1566
01:10:12.346 --> 01:10:13.542
(Lee Young) I’m here, I’m here

1567
01:10:13.609 --> 01:10:15.044
(Namkyung) Huh? I came by taxi

1568
01:10:15.111 --> 01:10:16.000
Hey, I'm leaving.

1569
01:10:16.067 --> 01:10:18.214
Let’s do another encore performance, here we go

1570
01:10:18.281 --> 01:10:19.567
(Lee Young) I just needed it once.

1571
01:10:19.634 --> 01:10:20.950
[Sound of taxi door opening]
(Residence in Japan) See you tomorrow

1572
01:10:22.289 --> 01:10:23.786
[Sound of taxi door closing]

1573
01:10:26.934 --> 01:10:28.934
[Calm music]

1574
01:10:29.859 --> 01:10:31.661
(Sabi) Why don’t you come like this?

1575
01:10:34.501 --> 01:10:35.365
you?

1576
01:10:36.133 --> 01:10:37.467
I haven't called you yet?

1577
01:10:38.038 --> 01:10:39.600
I'm going to see you guys go.

1578
01:10:39.667 --> 01:10:40.536
Ah...

1579
01:10:46.747 --> 01:10:47.615
Hey

1580
01:10:48.478 --> 01:10:49.850
Shall I give it a try?

1581
01:10:49.917 --> 01:10:50.913
what?

1582
01:10:52.000 --> 01:10:53.920
Hi, hello girl

1583
01:10:53.987 --> 01:10:55.318
Mr. Lee

1584
01:10:56.467 --> 01:10:58.554
(Jaeil) Hey, what are you, why didn’t you tell me?

1585
01:10:59.689 --> 01:11:00.690
you

1586
01:11:01.224 --> 01:11:03.026
How have you been excited about work?

1587
01:11:06.562 --> 01:11:08.698
I'm saying this because I feel like I need to do it correctly.

1588
01:11:09.803 --> 01:11:10.800
Hello girl is right

1589
01:11:12.468 --> 01:11:13.436
but not you

1590
01:11:14.167 --> 01:11:15.037
Huh?

1591
01:11:15.104 --> 01:11:17.674
I liked Thapki oppa, not you.

1592
01:11:18.474 --> 01:11:19.308
lie

1593
01:11:19.375 --> 01:11:20.876
(Sabi) And the first day you won first place

1594
01:11:20.943 --> 01:11:22.478
June 9th, not June 2nd

1595
01:11:23.012 --> 01:11:24.647
On the 2nd, I was the #1 candidate.

1596
01:11:24.714 --> 01:11:27.750
That hello girl guardian
They got the date wrong

1597
01:11:28.599 --> 01:11:30.100
Know exactly

1598
01:11:30.167 --> 01:11:31.087
Ah...

1599
01:11:32.088 --> 01:11:32.966
yes

1600
01:11:36.692 --> 01:11:37.693
I'm going

1601
01:11:38.467 --> 01:11:39.429
(Jae-il) Goodbye

1602
01:12:16.570 --> 01:12:18.201
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

1603
01:12:24.745 --> 01:12:26.042
Aren't you busy?

1604
01:12:27.210 --> 01:12:28.111
Yeah, whatever

1605
01:12:30.267 --> 01:12:32.948
It's because you don't want to eat with me
Did you lie?

1606
01:12:33.015 --> 01:12:34.683
Why do I lie like that?

1607
01:12:34.750 --> 01:12:36.986
Then why did you cancel the appointment?
And on the same day?

1608
01:12:41.195 --> 01:12:42.152
I'm sorry

1609
01:12:49.198 --> 01:12:50.971
(Lee Young) I was really looking forward to it, right?

1610
01:12:51.038 --> 01:12:52.702
Eating with someone I like

1611
01:12:58.011 --> 01:12:59.208
[light sigh]

1612
01:13:01.949 --> 01:13:03.361
Go in first

1613
01:13:11.487 --> 01:13:13.456
(Dowon) Actually, the restaurant was canceled today.

1614
01:13:14.156 --> 01:13:15.358
I also bought flowers

1615
01:13:17.827 --> 01:13:19.362
Oh, it's broken.

1616
01:13:22.469 --> 01:13:23.668
I also wrote down a card.

1617
01:13:31.879 --> 01:13:33.875
I left it behind, I really left it behind...

1618
01:13:37.408 --> 01:13:39.916
So this is the only thing left

1619
01:13:44.925 --> 01:13:45.846
I...

1620
01:13:50.163 --> 01:13:51.155
Oh I-young

1621
01:13:56.565 --> 01:13:57.337
Okay...
[Lee Young’s surprised gasp]
[Sound of bag being dropped]

1622
01:13:57.404 --> 01:13:59.035
[Calm music]

1623
01:14:00.841 --> 01:14:01.811
Do you like me?

1624
01:14:03.205 --> 01:14:04.038
really?

1625
01:14:06.409 --> 01:14:07.777
Are you confessing now?

1626
01:14:08.949 --> 01:14:09.927
yes

1627
01:14:14.988 --> 01:14:15.939
[happy laughter]

1628
01:14:19.088 --> 01:14:20.189
(Lee Young) Uh...

1629
01:14:22.858 --> 01:14:23.860
I...

1630
01:14:26.534 --> 01:14:28.163
Because I confessed a lot

1631
01:14:28.230 --> 01:14:29.432
You know without me saying it, right?

1632
01:14:33.703 --> 01:14:34.737
[Heavy breathing]

1633
01:14:39.313 --> 01:14:41.477
Uh, well, then...

1634
01:14:44.117 --> 01:14:45.098
Then

1635
01:14:47.534 --> 01:14:49.018
[Dowon’s embarrassed laughter]

1636
01:14:52.259 --> 01:14:53.280
We...

1637
01:14:55.300 --> 01:14:57.455
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1638
01:15:48.067 --> 01:15:49.512
[Elevator arrival sound]

1639
01:16:01.862 --> 01:16:02.719
(Lee Young) Ah

1640
01:16:03.225 --> 01:16:05.227
I'm going to keep it a secret from you for a while.

1641
01:16:06.328 --> 01:16:08.164
I saw that my sister's test tube was doing well.

1642
01:16:08.964 --> 01:16:10.166
I'll tell you then

1643
01:16:11.233 --> 01:16:12.672
I do whatever I want.

1644
01:16:12.739 --> 01:16:13.869
I'll do whatever I'm told

1645
01:16:21.081 --> 01:16:23.081
[Calm music]

1646
01:16:24.580 --> 01:16:25.548
[sigh]

1647
01:16:28.017 --> 01:16:29.018
[deep sigh]

1648
01:16:33.133 --> 01:16:35.100
[Door lock button sound]

1649
01:16:35.167 --> 01:16:36.092
[Door lock operating sound]

1650
01:16:40.796 --> 01:16:42.765
Oh, that's right

1651
01:16:44.471 --> 01:16:45.371
Ah!

1652
01:16:46.507 --> 01:16:47.710
Oh, you went on a trip, right?

1653
01:16:49.827 --> 01:16:51.173
You said you were sleeping

1654
01:16:51.240 --> 01:16:52.875
Did you say it was 3 nights and 4 days?

1655
01:16:54.076 --> 01:16:54.977
(Dowon) Ah!

1656
01:16:57.480 --> 01:17:00.282
I have to go to the hospital
Didn't I tell you?

1657
01:17:01.283 --> 01:17:02.251
(Lee Young) Yes

1658
01:17:02.968 --> 01:17:04.920
Well, the thing...

1659
01:17:05.654 --> 01:17:08.024
Oh, no, what is it, look at the paper.

1660
01:17:09.162 --> 01:17:10.430
- Yes?
- uh?

1661
01:17:10.497 --> 01:17:11.965
- uh?
- (Dowon) Oh, I forgot.

1662
01:17:12.032 --> 01:17:14.196
I'll sleep at the hospital
[Elevator button sound]

1663
01:17:16.098 --> 01:17:18.734
Oh, is it just the two of you in this empty house?

1664
01:17:20.687 --> 01:17:23.105
(Lee Young) No, continuing from before.
Were we alone together?

1665
01:17:26.513 --> 01:17:27.489
Ah

1666
01:17:28.310 --> 01:17:29.612
The house is a bit like that, isn’t it?

1667
01:17:35.122 --> 01:17:37.122
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1668
01:17:39.522 --> 01:17:40.790
Are you okay here?

1669
01:17:55.042 --> 01:17:56.338
[Elevator arrival sound]

1670
01:18:02.416 --> 01:18:05.047
Come on, I'll take you to the first floor.

1671
01:18:30.366 --> 01:18:31.507
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1672
01:18:32.208 --> 01:18:33.041
[Mouse operation sound]

1673
01:18:33.108 --> 01:18:35.310
(Nanjing) Pipo Pipo
I heard there was a notice posted?

1674
01:18:35.377 --> 01:18:36.483
[Mouse operation sound]

1675
01:18:36.550 --> 01:18:37.580
[Japanese lament]

1676
01:18:37.647 --> 01:18:40.000
(Jaeil) My fans saw this
What if they rush me to the hospital?

1677
01:18:40.067 --> 01:18:41.717
Don't worry, at least 8 people?

1678
01:18:42.418 --> 01:18:43.385
9 people including you?

1679
01:18:43.452 --> 01:18:44.625
Because it’s not me!
[Jaeil’s happy laughter]

1680
01:18:45.659 --> 01:18:48.157
(Namkyung) Write, but who is the main character?

1681
01:18:49.062 --> 01:18:50.826
[Surprisingly] Isn’t this Oh I-young?

1682
01:18:52.242 --> 01:18:54.830
Oh I-young
You gave birth in a room with cameras.

1683
01:18:54.897 --> 01:18:56.431
Uh, you said you should have surgery too.

1684
01:18:56.498 --> 01:18:58.033
Oh, that’s enough, it’s embarrassing.

1685
01:18:59.235 --> 01:19:00.502
(Jae-il) Oh, here it is

1686
01:19:00.569 --> 01:19:01.840
Pipo Pipo Episode 1 Preview
[Nanjing’s response]

1687
01:19:01.907 --> 01:19:02.843
[Mouse operation sound]

1688
01:19:02.910 --> 01:19:04.233
[Tense music plays]
(Youngseok in the video) 2023

1689
01:19:04.300 --> 01:19:05.819
- A new paradigm in human entertainment
- (Eunwon in the video) Please be careful.

1690
01:19:05.886 --> 01:19:07.750
(Youngseok in the video) Jang Youngseok’s Bipbo Bippo
[Siren sound effect]

1691
01:19:08.248 --> 01:19:10.734
Not even for a moment
A place where you can't let go of tension

1692
01:19:10.801 --> 01:19:13.215
[Scream of the tree in the video]
(Lee Young in the video) Harder, for the last time

1693
01:19:13.282 --> 01:19:15.951
(Eunwon in the video) Baby monitor
Did you wait until it fell or what?

1694
01:19:16.018 --> 01:19:17.352
Don't you have that much judgment?

1695
01:19:17.419 --> 01:19:20.689
(Youngseok in the video) A fleeting moment
Decide on a person's life and death

1696
01:19:20.756 --> 01:19:23.759
A place where moments come together to create miracles

1697
01:19:23.826 --> 01:19:26.028
And a place to meet beautiful people

1698
01:19:26.095 --> 01:19:27.162
[Soft music plays]
(Eunwon in the video) Don’t worry

1699
01:19:27.229 --> 01:19:29.031
If you don’t know something, ask anytime

1700
01:19:29.901 --> 01:19:32.034
Seeing a mother whose water broke
[Sparkling sound effect]

1701
01:19:32.101 --> 01:19:34.141
How can you pretend not to know?

1702
01:19:34.208 --> 01:19:37.006
Still, the mother is lucky.

1703
01:19:37.611 --> 01:19:40.447
(Youngseok in the video) From Youngseok Jang’s Pipo Pipo
Check it out

1704
01:19:42.634 --> 01:19:44.747
[laughter]

1705
01:19:46.420 --> 01:19:47.950
Is it Myungwon again?

1706
01:19:48.017 --> 01:19:48.951
(Lee Young) Again?

1707
01:19:49.018 --> 01:19:50.390
No, why is it working?

1708
01:19:50.457 --> 01:19:51.720
[Slams the desk] Oh, why?

1709
01:19:52.621 --> 01:19:55.028
(Nankyung) Hey, that’s
It’s not Teacher Myeong-eun-won’s fault.

1710
01:19:55.095 --> 01:19:56.792
Ah, Mr. PD Jang, really.

1711
01:19:57.931 --> 01:19:59.695
(Lee Young) I will never again
Look at Jang Young-seok.

1712
01:20:01.602 --> 01:20:02.706
[Sound of door closing]

1713
01:20:02.773 --> 01:20:04.766
[bursts of laughter]

1714
01:20:04.833 --> 01:20:06.769
(Namkyung) Hey, hey, did you see Oiyoung’s expression?

1715
01:20:08.103 --> 01:20:09.071
(Jaeil) How many seconds was it?

1716
01:20:09.138 --> 01:20:10.539
- (Xavi) 17 seconds
- (Nanjing) 17?

1717
01:20:14.014 --> 01:20:14.956
(Eunwon) After work?

1718
01:20:17.451 --> 01:20:18.418
Did you see it?

1719
01:20:18.485 --> 01:20:19.481
(Lee Young) No

1720
01:20:20.754 --> 01:20:21.955
(Eunwon) What?

1721
01:20:22.022 --> 01:20:22.855
(Lee Young) Yes?

1722
01:20:23.323 --> 01:20:24.491
(Eunwon) What are you saying you didn’t see?

1723
01:20:37.499 --> 01:20:38.500
[Painful elasticity]

1724
01:20:39.847 --> 01:20:41.003
Hey!

1725
01:20:41.070 --> 01:20:42.104
(Lee Young) Oh, hey.

1726
01:20:42.171 --> 01:20:43.372
Please be careful

1727
01:20:46.108 --> 01:20:47.109
Let's go

1728
01:20:54.721 --> 01:20:55.805
[annoying elasticity]

1729
01:20:56.834 --> 01:20:58.391
[Sound of footsteps moving away]

1730
01:20:58.458 --> 01:21:00.756
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1731
01:21:40.232 --> 01:21:41.734
(Nanjing) Professors
Isn’t it a little strange these days?

1732
01:21:41.801 --> 01:21:42.636
(Lee Young) What?

1733
01:21:42.703 --> 01:21:43.867
A bloody rivalry

1734
01:21:43.934 --> 01:21:46.467
(Jeongmin) To Professor Gong Gong-seon
Did I tell you that the surgery was delayed?

1735
01:21:46.534 --> 01:21:48.170
(Kiseon) No, I gave them both ways.
Of course I should write it

1736
01:21:48.237 --> 01:21:49.571
Why do you use it all yourself, why?

1737
01:21:49.638 --> 01:21:50.605
I have to write that

1738
01:21:50.672 --> 01:21:52.679
(Jeongmin) That’s what I was trying to say now.

1739
01:21:52.746 --> 01:21:53.775
I have to write it

1740
01:21:53.842 --> 01:21:55.438
(Kiseon) Are you having a fight with me now?

1741
01:21:55.505 --> 01:21:56.411
(Lee Young) I am the mother of Professor Seo Jeong-min.

1742
01:21:56.478 --> 01:21:57.446
(Namkyung) Oh, just stay still.

1743
01:21:57.513 --> 01:21:59.000
That professor Gong Gong-seon

1744
01:21:59.067 --> 01:22:01.367
(Lee Young) Then, take a break as an outpatient.
Come and see me at lunch time

1745
01:22:01.434 --> 01:22:03.385
How many times have I said that I just heard it too?

1746
01:22:04.018 --> 01:22:05.220
(Lee Young) I’ll go quickly

1747
01:22:05.287 --> 01:22:06.200
Did you guys fight?

1748
01:22:06.267 --> 01:22:07.723
- (together) No!
- (Sabi) Did you fight?

1749
01:22:07.790 --> 01:22:09.500
(Lee Young) What are you fighting for?
Why fight with him?

1750
01:22:09.567 --> 01:22:11.499
(Dowon) Who among you is worse?
Are you competing?

1751
01:22:11.566 --> 01:22:13.267
[telephone ringing sound]
(Namkyung) Yes?

1752
01:22:13.334 --> 01:22:14.396
What are you doing?

1753
01:22:14.463 --> 01:22:16.565
- (Jooyoung) Married? you?
- (Seungwon) Who is it?

1754
01:22:16.632 --> 01:22:17.632
(Jooyoung) Are you from the hospital?

1755
01:22:17.699 --> 01:22:20.307
(Dowon) Do you want to keep it a secret?
Do you want to start a rumor?

1756
01:22:20.374 --> 01:22:21.875
(Lee Young) First-year kids don’t know anything.

1757
01:22:21.942 --> 01:22:24.106
Still, I wonder if I should tell you first.

1758
01:22:24.173 --> 01:22:25.774
- (Nanjing) Who?
- Have you ever

1759
01:22:26.613 --> 01:22:28.343
(Junmo) Oh, what are you doing now?

1760
01:22:28.410 --> 01:22:30.746
Hey, you're in the hospital
Are you coming to save people?

1761
01:22:30.813 --> 01:22:31.980
Or are you coming to kill me?

1762
01:22:32.047 --> 01:22:32.814
(Sabi) I’m sorry

1763
01:22:32.881 --> 01:22:34.066
(Japan) If you want to be alone

1764
01:22:34.133 --> 01:22:37.085
Come here during the day, go there at night

1765
01:22:37.152 --> 01:22:38.534
(Ikjun) It’s been so long since I came here

1766
